# Veripsa release gate (auto-discovered). One gate per file -> two PRs adding gates add two FILES, never a
# shared line -> no false merge conflict on registration. register_gate is defined in run_gates.sh.
# Format: register_gate <test> <marker> <name> <ok_blurb> <desc> [tail]
register_gate "tests/test_php_use_function.py" "PHP-USE-FUNCTION GATE: PASS" "PHP use function/const precision (no false file edge for symbol imports)" "PHP use-function/use-const precision: use function A\B\format and use const A\B\MAX name a FUNCTION/CONST SYMBOL, not a file path. Before this fix _dotted_imports treated namespace_use_clause nodes identically whether they held a function/const keyword or not, emitting an imports edge whose dst suffix-matched any same-basename .php file (confirmed on laravel/framework: 10 spurious edges, e.g. use function Laravel\Prompts\confirm hit Confirm.php). A false edge is a false pause tier signal. Fix: detect the function/const keyword node as a direct child of namespace_use_clause (single import) or as a direct child of namespace_use_declaration (grouped use function/const A\B\{...}), and return [] immediately -- no file edge for symbol imports. Plain class use A\B\Widget is unaffected (no keyword child). Verified on laravel/framework: 10 spurious use-function/const edges eliminated, 4 legitimate class-import edges to Password.php preserved." "PHP use function/const precision: skip imports edge for use function and use const declarations (function/const keyword in namespace_use_clause or namespace_use_declaration signals a symbol import, not a file path -- prevents false pause-tier coupling)" 9
